    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Outdoor Learning (OL) and Outdoor Adventure Education (OAE) provide a learning environment conducive for improving self-esteem, teaching interpersonal personal skills, creating an environmentally aware community, and serve as an experiential learning technique for underprivileged children.  Even though OL and OAE can be costly, the benefits are clear and private and public funding for these programs must increase.",
